[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    529[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     }
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    530[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    531[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     /// A `c2r`: unit rotations, plus the non-unit / zero / NaN cases the C
